{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51997","headline":"缺题五古诗 一 · 魏徵","name":"缺题五古诗 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"大道夷且长，窘路狭且促。\n修翼无卑栖，远趾不步局。\n舒吾凌霄羽，奋此千里足。\n超迈绝尘驱，倐忽谁能逐？\n贤愚岂常类，禀性在清浊。\n富贵有人籍，贫贱无天录。\n通塞苟由己，志士不相卜。\n陈平敖里社，韩信钓河曲。\n终居天下宰，食此万锺禄。\n德音流千载，功名重山岳。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"魏徵","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51997.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51997","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}